{"product_id":"matrix-smart-watch","title":"Matrix Pro AMOLED Smart Watch","description":"\u003cp\u003eUpgrade your lifestyle to the MAX with Matrix Smart Watch having a premium AMOLED Display, Pakistan's first Stainless-Steel Strap \u0026amp; a Functional Crown.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eMatrix Pro Smartwatch Product Description\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Matrix smartwatch is your ideal companion for staying connected, monitoring your health, and enhancing your daily activities. Whether you're at the office, the gym, or out on the town, the Matrix Smartwatch fits seamlessly into your lifestyle.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith advanced technology and a sleek look, the Vision Smartwatch offers both practicality and elegance in one wearable device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Matrix Pro Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Matrix Smartwatch is equipped with a range of features to keep you on track and connected. Its advanced fitness tracking includes heart rate monitoring, sleep analysis, and various sports modes.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay updated with smart notifications for calls, messages, and social media alerts, all displayed on a vibrant, high-resolution screen. The long-lasting battery ensures you stay powered throughout your day, and customizable watch faces and interchangeable straps let you personalize your look.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Matrix Pro Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDisplay: 1.3-inch AMOLED full touch screen\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eResolution: 360 x 360 pixels\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSensors: Heart rate monitor, SpO2 monitor, accelerometer\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompatibility: iOS and Android\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStrap Material: Silicone (interchangeable)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDimensions: 45 x 38 x 10 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConnectivity: Bluetooth 5.0\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBattery Life: Up to 8 days\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWater Resistance: IP67 rating\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWeight: 42g\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Matrix Pro SmartWatch?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOpting for the Matrix Smartwatch means choosing a device that enhances your life with its advanced features and stylish design. Its comprehensive health tracking, seamless connectivity, and elegant appearance make it a top choice. Plus, with our dedicated customer support, you can enjoy a hassle-free experience from purchase to daily use.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Forest Green","offer_id":47322178257174,"sku":"20140","price":12999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Gold","offer_id":47223445586198,"sku":"20138","price":12999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Misty Grey","offer_id":47322178224406,"sku":"20139","price":12999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Jet Black","offer_id":47322178191638,"sku":"20135","price":12999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Silver","offer_id":47223445553430,"sku":"20137","price":12999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black","offer_id":47223445520662,"sku":"20136","price":12999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/ProBlackTopviewwithstrapwithoutBG.webp?v=1706183349","url":"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/products\/matrix-smart-watch","provider":"ZeroLifestyle.co","version":"1.0","type":"link"}